    "_comment_IMAGE": "Avatar repairs only, and only when the owner asks for one. No article pipeline has a gpt-image-2 call site and none may gain one: both magazines illustrate from keyless licensed archives with a deterministic SVG plate as the last rung, and the ledger has never carried a kind:\"image\" entry. AVATAR_IMAGE below is the role that is actually used.",
